<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink181-kilavi">
       ikkaḷavoḻukkam neṭitucelliṉ ivvūrkkaṇ alar piṟakkumeṉṟu añciyirunta talaivi talaimakaṉ varaintukoḷḷat tuṇintāṉ eṉṟukūṟiya tōḻikkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
         Spoken to the confidante who said that the hero has decided to marry, [to] the heroine who was afraid that gossip would rise in this town if [their] clandestine phase [of love] goes on [any] longer.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink181">
<l>neyta luṇka ṇēriṟaip paṇaittōṭ</l>
<l>poyta lāṭiya poyyā makaḷir</l>
<l>kuppai veṇmaṇaṟ kuravai niṟūun</l>
<l>tuṟaikeḻu koṇka ṉalki</l>
<l>ṉuṟaiviṉi tammaviv vaḻuṅka lūrē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>If the man from the sea that has ghats</l>
        <l>In which faultless girls [with] kajaled eyes [like] Neytal flowers,</l>
        <l>[And] straight [= beautiful], bent [= supple] bamboo-shoulders</l>
        <l>That played the Poytal game</l>
        <l>Grants [his love],</l>
        <l>Staying in this gossiping town is sweet indeed!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
